# Frontend Architecture (Next.js)

Scribely frontend is a Next.js 14 marketing website (landing, blog, pricing, download, contact). It uses the App Router and does not run the desktop app — that is a separate Electron project.

## File Organization

```
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── app/                    # App Router (Next.js 14)
│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout: Navbar, Footer, fonts
│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Home: Hero, Features, HowItWorks, etc.
│   │   ├── globals.css         # Tailwind + CSS variables
│   │   ├── (app)/              # Route group
│   │   │   └── layout.tsx
│   │   ├── about/
│   │   ├── blog/               # Blog listing + [slug] dynamic route
│   │   ├── contact/
│   │   ├── download/           # Download page
│   │   ├── pricing/
│   │   ├── privacy/
│   │   ├── setup/              # Setup guide
│   │   ├── terms/
│   │   └── api/                # API routes (e.g. contact form)
│   │       └── contact/route.ts
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── layout/             # Navbar, Footer
│   │   ├── landing/            # Hero, Features, HowItWorks, FAQ, CTA, etc.
│   │   ├── pricing/            # Pricing cards, feature table
│   │   ├── blog/               # Blog components
│   │   ├── download/           # Download cards
│   │   ├── setup/              # Setup guide
│   │   └── ui/                 # Reusable: Button, Accordion, Badge, ShaderBackground
│   └── lib/
│       ├── utils.ts            # cn(), etc.
│       └── blog-posts.ts        # Blog content/metadata
├── package.json
└── tailwind.config.ts
```

## Tech Stack

- **Next.js 14** with App Router
- **React 18**, **Tailwind CSS**, **Framer Motion**
- **Radix UI** (Accordion, NavigationMenu, Separator, Slot)
- **Lucide React** for icons
- **class-variance-authority** + **clsx** + **tailwind-merge** for component variants

## Key Patterns

- **Layout**: Root layout wraps all pages with Navbar + Footer; dark theme by default
- **Fonts**: Inter (body), Space Grotesk (headings) via `next/font/google`
- **Metadata**: Centralized in `layout.tsx`; `metadataBase` for scribely.app
- **API routes**: Server actions or Route Handlers in `app/api/`
- **Styling**: Tailwind + `@/components/ui` for shared primitives

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev      # localhost:3000
npm run build
npm run lint
```
